   "learnt": "The most valuable lesson I have learned from our team members we serve is that mutual trust is the foundation of any lasting impact. No system, process, or data model can succeed without deeply understanding ground realities and the lived experiences of the people. This learning drives me to ensure that our records and programs remain completely honest, transparent, and responsive to their actual needs",
